# Icon sets are pure derivatives of apps/sync/src-tauri/icons/app-icon.png and
# are regenerated by `pnpm icons` (wired into every ios:*/android:* script).
# They were previously committed as Tauri's placeholder logo, which is exactly
# the drift keeping generated bytes out of git prevents.
src-tauri/icons
src-tauri/gen/apple/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/*.png
